---
source: apollo-router/src/configuration/compatibility.rs
description: flat headers.all.request migrates under an operations key
expression: changed_settings(&config)
---
{
  "/headers": {
    "all": {
      "request": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "propagate": {
              "named": "x-request-id"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
